From 4165015f49bd554cfa97fb1b8ff1e72d2fe1b763 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: johnmart19 <johnivan19999@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 28 Sep 2026 09:25:45 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] input: Import Alioth stock AW8697 driver

Import drivers/input/misc/aw8697_haptic unchanged from MiCode
Xiaomi_Kernel_OpenSource alioth-r-oss commit
2fdca387269615872d4ff798e8da7d33345c1338.

Wire the stock driver into the input build. This Alioth kernel does not
carry the previous Dagu/Psyche haptic implementations. Compatibility
and safety fixes are kept separate from the original stock source.

Co-authored-by: codex <noreply@openai.com>
---
